    <string name="onb_welcome_title">Welcome to Repisa</string>
    <string name="onb_welcome_body">Repisa puts all your games — Steam, Epic Games and emulators — on wooden shelves as real boxes, with their cover, playtime, scores, achievements and your own ratings. Let\'s set it up in a minute.</string>
    <string name="onb_backup_body">Do you have a Repisa backup (for example, from another console or an older version)? Import it now and everything comes back.</string>
    <string name="onb_start">Let\'s start</string>
    <string name="onb_import">I have a backup: import it</string>
    <string name="onb_pc_title">Your PC games</string>
    <string name="onb_pc_body">Link Steam (also your Family group) and Epic Games by signing in on their official pages. Repisa only reads your games and hours. They are at the top of Settings; when you come back, the guide continues.</string>
    <string name="onb_pc_link">Link Steam / Epic</string>
    <string name="onb_skip_step">Not now</string>
    <string name="onb_next">Next</string>
    <string name="onb_emu_title">Your emulators</string>
    <string name="onb_emu_body">Choose the folder where you keep your ROMs (just the main one: Repisa looks inside for switch/, gba/, ps2/…). Repisa will detect your installed emulators and open each game directly. Cocoon, ES-DE and RetroArch are in Settings → Emulators.</string>
    <string name="onb_emu_added">%1$d folder(s) added</string>
    <string name="onb_time_title">Playtime</string>
    <string name="onb_time_body">Allow “Usage access” so Repisa can measure exactly how long you play the games you open from here (only the time the emulator is on screen). Android will open the setting: find Repisa and turn it on.</string>
    <string name="onb_done_title">All set!</string>
    <string name="onb_done_body" formatted="false">Controller: D-pad to move · A details · X play · Y favourite · B back · L1/R1 platform · Select shelves · Start settings.\n🎲 next to the magnifier picks a game for you · tap the totals at the top for statistics · mark each game Backlog / Playing / Finished / 100% / Dropped · 🏆 achievements from Steam, RetroAchievements and Repisa.</string>
    <string name="onb_finish">Let\'s play!</string>
    <string name="onb_skip_all">Skip the guide</string>
